---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const sections = [
  {
    id: 'overview',
    title: 'Overview',
    content: [
      'Glade is a desktop application for building and managing Bayesian statistical analysis workflows. It provides a visual graph canvas where each step of your analysis — data loading, prior specification, model fitting, diagnostics, and decision recording — is represented as a connected node.',
      'The environment maintains a live connection to a Bayesgrove R session. Obligations and recommended actions are surfaced directly from the protocol state, so validation steps are never missed.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'architecture',
    title: 'Architecture',
    content: [
      'Glade uses a layered architecture: an Electron shell manages native integration (file picking, auto-updates), a React web layer renders the user interface, and a local server communicates with the Bayesgrove R process over WebSocket.',
      'The workflow state is managed through a normalized graph store with automatic persistence to SQLite. Node positions use ELK-based layout with manual override support.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'canvas',
    title: 'Workflow Canvas',
    content: [
      'The canvas is the primary workspace. Nodes represent analytical operations and are connected by directed edges encoding dependency relationships. Nodes can be created, annotated, connected, and rearranged via drag-and-drop.',
      'A detail drawer provides access to node metadata, decision records, file attachments, and execution history. The canvas supports multi-select, zoom-to-fit, and ELK automatic repositioning.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'repl',
    title: 'R Session',
    content: [
      'An embedded xterm.js terminal provides direct access to the Bayesgrove R REPL. Features include command history (up/down arrows), tab completion, session clearing, and the ability to detach the terminal into a separate window.',
      'A secondary "Process Log" tab displays unfiltered R process output for debugging. The R executable path, project directory, and preferred editor command are all configurable in Settings.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'protocol',
    title: 'Protocol System',
    content: [
      'Bayesgrove defines a protocol for analysis workflow management. Glade surfaces two protocol-driven interfaces: obligation panels (blocking and advisory review tasks) and action panels (recommended operations pending user approval).',
      'Obligations are organized by scope with severity indicators. Actions include full parameter inspection, invocation fields (dropdowns, text inputs, multi-line textareas), and template references before execution.',
    ],
  },
];
---

<Layout title="Glade — Documentation">
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;0,6..72,600;1,6..72,400&display=swap');

    :root {
      --bg: #ffffff;
      --sidebar-bg: #fafafa;
      --border: #e5e5e5;
      --border-strong: #d4d4d4;
      --text: #171717;
      --text-secondary: #525252;
      --text-muted: #a3a3a3;
      --accent: #2563eb;
      --accent-bg: #eff6ff;
      --code-bg: #f5f5f5;
      --nav-w: 200px;
      --content-w: 640px;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Newsreader', 'Georgia', serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .shell {
      display: flex;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* Sidebar navigation */
    nav {
      width: var(--nav-w);
      background: var(--sidebar-bg);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 32px 0;
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    }

    .nav-brand {
      padding: 0 20px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .nav-brand-name {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .nav-brand-ver {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .nav-group {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .nav-group-title {
      padding: 0 20px;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .nav-link {
      display: block;
      padding: 6px 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-left: 2px solid transparent;
      transition: all 0.15s;
    }

    .nav-link:hover {
      color: var(--text);
      background: #f0f0f0;
    }

    .nav-link.active {
      color: var(--accent);
      border-left-color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent-bg);
    }

    /* Main content */
    .content {
      margin-left: var(--nav-w);
      max-width: var(--content-w);
      margin-right: auto;
      padding: 48px 48px 96px;
    }

    /* Breadcrumb */
    .breadcrumb {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .breadcrumb span {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    /* Page title */
    .page-title {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .page-desc {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
      padding-bottom: 32px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    /* Section */
    .section {
      margin-bottom: 48px;
      scroll-margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .section h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .section-anchor {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin-left: 8px;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.15s;
    }

    .section h2:hover .section-anchor {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .section p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.75;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    /* Callout */
    .callout {
      background: var(--accent-bg);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      padding: 12px 16px;
      margin: 16px 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .callout strong {
      color: var(--text);
    }

    /* Inline code */
    code:not(pre code) {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      background: var(--code-bg);
      padding: 2px 5px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    /* Code block */
    pre {
      background: var(--code-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      margin: 16px 0;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    pre code {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .code-caption {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    /* Spec table */
    .spec-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }

    .spec-table th {
      text-align: left;
      font-weight: 500;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-strong);
      padding: 8px 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .spec-table td {
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      vertical-align: top;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    .spec-table td:first-child {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    /* Requirement badges */
    .req {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .req-yes { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
    .req-partial { background: #fef9c3; color: #854d0e; }
    .req-no { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }

    /* Footer */
    .doc-footer {
      margin-top: 64px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      nav { display: none; }
      .content { margin-left: 0; padding: 24px 20px 64px; }
    }
  </style>

  <div class="shell">
    <nav>
      <div class="nav-brand">
        <div class="nav-brand-name">glade</div>
        <div class="nav-brand-ver">v0.13.4</div>
      </div>

      <div class="nav-group">
        <div class="nav-group-title">Getting Started</div>
        <a href="#overview" class="nav-link active">Overview</a>
        <a href="#architecture" class="nav-link">Architecture</a>
        <a href="#canvas" class="nav-link">Workflow Canvas</a>
      </div>

      <div class="nav-group">
        <div class="nav-group-title">Components</div>
        <a href="#repl" class="nav-link">R Session</a>
        <a href="#protocol" class="nav-link">Protocol System</a>
      </div>

      <div class="nav-group">
        <div class="nav-group-title">Reference</div>
        <a href="#requirements" class="nav-link">Requirements</a>
        <a href="#configuration" class="nav-link">Configuration</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="content">
      <div class="breadcrumb">glade / <span>documentation</span></div>

      <h1 class="page-title">Documentation</h1>
      <p class="page-desc">
        Glade is a desktop application for building and managing Bayesian statistical analysis workflows.
        This reference covers the system architecture, user interface components, and configuration options.
      </p>

      {sections.map((s) => (
        <section class="section" id={s.id}>
          <h2>
            {s.title}
            <a href={`#${s.id}`} class="section-anchor">&para;</a>
          </h2>
          {s.content.map((p) => <p>{p}</p>)}
        </section>
      ))}

      <section class="section" id="requirements">
        <h2>
          System Requirements
          <a href="#requirements" class="section-anchor">&para;</a>
        </h2>
        <table class="spec-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Requirement</th>
              <th>Minimum</th>
              <th>Recommended</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>R</td>
              <td><span class="req req-yes">4.3</span></td>
              <td>4.4 or later</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>bayesgrove</td>
              <td><span class="req req-yes">0.8</span></td>
              <td>Latest CRAN release</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>macOS</td>
              <td>13 (Ventura)</td>
              <td>14 (Sonoma)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Linux</td>
              <td>glibc 2.35+</td>
              <td>Ubuntu 24.04</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Windows</td>
              <td>10 (1903+)</td>
              <td>11</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>RAM</td>
              <td>4 GB</td>
              <td>8 GB</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Disk</td>
              <td>200 MB</td>
              <td>500 MB (with R cache)</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <div class="callout">
          <strong>Note:</strong> The Bayesgrove R package must be installed separately. Glade does not
          manage R package installation. Run <code>install.packages("bayesgrove")</code> in your R session
          before first use.
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="configuration">
        <h2>
          Configuration
          <a href="#configuration" class="section-anchor">&para;</a>
        </h2>
        <p>Configuration is available through the desktop Settings page (<code>Settings &rarr; Desktop Environment</code>).</p>

        <p class="code-caption">settings fields</p>
        <table class="spec-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Field</th>
              <th>Description</th>
              <th>Default</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>projectPath</td>
              <td>Directory for Glade project files and state</td>
              <td><code>~/.glade/project</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>rExecutablePath</td>
              <td>Path to the R binary used for the Bayesgrove session</td>
              <td><code>auto</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>editorCommand</td>
              <td>External editor launched for file inspection</td>
              <td><code>auto</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>updateChannel</td>
              <td>Release channel for automatic updates</td>
              <td><code>stable</code></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </section>

      <footer class="doc-footer">
        <span>Glade v0.13.4</span>
        <span>{new Date().getFullYear()}</span>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>
